        "title": "The compound is woven from the living branches of four sturdy oaks into…",
        "text": "The compound is woven from the living branches of four sturdy oaks into three platforms. The lowest is about 10 feet above ground, with a root-and-branch slope as the obvious route up; the enclosed central platform is about 20 feet high, with window-sized gaps and a door facing the garden. A smaller platform sits about 30 feet up and connects to the central level by another slope. Two small wooden huts and a large outhouse stand below.",
