    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "You step into plain view and hand Finethir over to Guz. Guz takes the sheep and turns to his wolves, who close around him, their iron collars catching the light. The hulking, cloaked figure follows as Guz starts away through the crowd.\n\nYou fall into step beside them and ask to be taken to Noke. Guz gives you a hard look, one hand still on his greatsword. “You’ll see Master Noke,” he says, brusque and certain. He keeps moving, with Finethir and the wolves in his custody. The crowd’s shouts and scattered screams fade behind you as the group leaves; where Guz will take you next remains ahead.",
      "event_id": 488,
