      "content": "You continue along the well-trodden track as it winds through a gap in the bushes and among the tall oaks. Many overlapping prints mark the earth, though the sparse woodland around you is quiet and apparently uninhabited.\n\nYou have not yet reached Noke’s home; the track continues ahead. What do you do?",
