    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I look around Noke’s home. Describe the buildings, doors, terrain, and visible inhabitants so I can decide how to approach.",
      "event_id": 500,
      "citations": [],
      "rules_edition": null,
      "ruling_citation_ids": [],
      "turn_id": null,
      "roll_status": null,
      "roll": null,
      "created_at": "2026-10-22T10:30:35.736270Z"
    },
    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "Through the treetops, Noke’s strange home comes into view: living branches woven into three platforms among four sturdy oaks. The lowest platform sits about ten feet above the ground, reached by an obvious slope of roots and branches. Above it, an enclosed wooden-and-branch structure occupies the central platform, about twenty feet up; window-sized gaps punctuate its walls, and a door faces a flowered, bowl-shaped garden. A smaller platform rises higher still, about thirty feet up, connected to the central level by another sloping branch route.\n\nOn the lawn below, three great apes lounge or play with oversized dice beside iron greatswords. Two small wooden huts and a large outhouse stand beneath the platforms. You can approach the root-and-branch slope, the garden-facing door, or the ground-level buildings. What do you do?",
      "event_id": 500,
      "citations": [
        {
          "page": 6,
          "source": "wild_sheep_chase_chapter_source_fidelity_demonstration",
