    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "You call out from the lawn, plainly visible beneath the woven platforms. For a moment, nothing answers. Then a man’s voice snaps from within the enclosed structure on the central platform, where Noke is working furiously on new spells.\n\n“Return the sheep!” he demands. “Do so, and I won’t destroy you all!”\n\nThe words carry through the window-sized gaps in the branch walls. The flowered garden lies between you and the door facing it; the three great apes remain on the lawn beside their iron greatswords. Noke has heard you, but he has not come outside. What do you say or do?",
